{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And they journeyed from the Sea of Reeds and encamped in the wilderness of Sin.</b> This is not Sinai, for afterward it says, ״ויסעו מרפידים ויחנו במדבר סיני״ — and they journeyed from Rephidim and encamped in the wilderness of Sinai; rather, the wilderness of Sin is a place between Elim and Sinai, as written in the portion of Beshalach (Exodus 16)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:37:40.891858909Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}